---
title: Classic Taco Salad
source: Matt
servings: 6
prep time: 30 minutes
cook time: 0 minutes
---

Brown the @ground beef{1%pound} and add @taco seasoning{1%package} and @water{} according to package instructions.

Place in a #large bowl{} and add @black beans{14%oz}(drained), @grape tomatoes{1%cup}(halved), @lettuce{1%head}(shredded), @cheddar cheese{12%oz}, and @doritos{}.

Mix well.

Add @catalina dressing{} and mix again.

Serve immediately.
